  "caveats": [
    "One client archive contains36503 earlier-session events; they were excluded from the new-capture calculations",
    "Control echoes are sealedPING-to-receivedPONG on the same clock, not application echo or ICMP RTT",
    "Observed payload-quiescent windows are not proof that every application socket and maintenance task was idle",
    "IMAP wrapper duration includes local admission, network, parsing and callbacks; do not replay it as independent backend delay",
    "Socket failure events with stream IDs describe application/upstream sockets, not automatically IMAP transport reconnects",
    "Completed OPEN_OK is not a completed TLS handshake or Speedtest; early server startup and some prior client history rotated out",
    "WALLET_EXHAUSTED batch completions are retryable pre-APPEND outcomes in this code, not proof of overdraw, data corruption or one Speedtest failure per event"
  ]
